      "side": 1,
      "message": "It looks like all the tables, except `thermistor_3V3_30K9_47K_4050B` include 5 degree increments starting at 80C.  `thermistor_3V3_30K9_47K_4050B` uses 10 degree increments throughout.\n\nAlso, I see upstream a preference to add the table in C code (https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/pull/57368).  Should this be added upstream instead?\n\nIs the THERMISTOR_3V3_30K9_47K_4050B definition considered \"standard\"?",
      "parentUuid": "b9e3a7e6_00033d00",
