      "writtenOn": "2023-08-01T16:20:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The compensation table is generated by the R25 and Beta values (47K and 4050B here).  The table is consistent based off of those.  I think the ideal upstream solution would be to generate this table from these inputs from reading these properties from device tree during compile time. Upstreaming tables for commonly used NTC thermistors could clutter the code base.  I created this script https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/blob/main/scripts/utils/ntc_thermistor_table.py to help alleviate clutter but its now obsolete from changes to thermistor code upstream.",
